  "label": "Textual mockery of race mapped onto visual of person in Native American regalia",
  "description": "The text '1-800-abos-r-dum, thats' and '1-800-abos-r-dum!' in the top panel is mapped onto the visual of the person in Native American regalia, implying that the person is being mocked for their race through phonetic mimicry of a racial slur. This creates an analogical mapping where the text's derogatory intent is visually anchored to the image of the person in regalia, which is then used to stereotype the Black man in the bottom panel.",
